note mix.om: the error 12 fix. Same value from two helpers with few live names each
note mix = p + q + r + xor p q + xor q r + 2 * (a + b + c + d + e + f), p = a*d, q = b*e, r = c*f
fn prods a ulong b ulong c ulong d ulong e ulong f ulong to ulong
p = mul a d
q = mul b e
r = mul c f
ret add add add p q r add xor p q and q r
end
fn mix a ulong b ulong c ulong d ulong e ulong f ulong to ulong
m = prods a b c d e f
s = add add add a b add c d add e f
ret add m add s s
end
fn main to int
k = mix 3 5 7 11 13 17
ret int rem k 251
end
